        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86347, Cast Bronze Fluted Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Fluted Cast Bronze Pull is available in flat black bronze and medium bronze finishes. Choose from either 12 inch or 18 inch sizes. The Cast Bronze Fluted Handle is great for rustic, southern decors such as on farmhouses or historic or Colonial homes and businesses. The Fluted Door Handle is easy to install and comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware to thru-bolt it on a door up to 1-3/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/fluted-back-to-back-door-handle-pair-emtek-btb-86347\"><b>Fluted Pull with Back-to-Back Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Fluted Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Lost Wax Cast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) 1\" long 1/4\"-20 screws, (2) 1\" long #10-32 screws, (2) 2\" #10-32 screws, and (2) screw caps.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86347-specifications.pdf?v=1704262359\"><b>Emtek Fluted Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86347:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86348:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually with thru-bolt mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-lost-wax-finish.jpg?v=1704354555\" width=\"394\" height=\"189\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
